    es:{"Choose a lesson":"Elige una lección","Spanish":"Español","French":"Francés","Chinese":"Chino","Hindi":"Hindi","Grade 1 Science":"Ciencias de 1.er grado","Back to Grade 1":"Volver a 1.er grado","Independent practice across reading, math, and science.":"Práctica independiente de lectura, matemáticas y ciencias.","Living and Nonliving Things":"Seres vivos y objetos no vivos","Sort living things from nonliving objects.":"Distingue los seres vivos de los objetos no vivos.","Plants and Their Needs":"Las plantas y sus necesidades","Explore plant parts and what plants need to grow.":"Explora las partes de una planta y lo que necesita para crecer.","Animals and Habitats":"Animales y hábitats","Match animals with their needs and homes.":"Relaciona los animales con sus necesidades y hogares.","Weather and Seasons":"El tiempo y las estaciones","Observe weather and connect it to the seasons.":"Observa el tiempo y relaciónalo con las estaciones.","Materials and Properties":"Materiales y propiedades","Compare objects by texture, strength, and flexibility.":"Compara objetos por textura, resistencia y flexibilidad.","Light, Sound, and Motion":"Luz, sonido y movimiento","Investigate how things move, shine, and make sounds.":"Investiga cómo se mueven, brillan y producen sonidos las cosas."},
    fr:{"Choose a lesson":"Choisissez une leçon","Spanish":"Espagnol","French":"Français","Chinese":"Chinois","Hindi":"Hindi","Grade 1 Science":"Sciences — niveau 1","Back to Grade 1":"Retour au niveau 1","Independent practice across reading, math, and science.":"Entraînement autonome en lecture, mathématiques et sciences.","Living and Nonliving Things":"Vivant et non-vivant","Sort living things from nonliving objects.":"Distinguez les êtres vivants des objets non vivants.","Plants and Their Needs":"Les plantes et leurs besoins","Explore plant parts and what plants need to grow.":"Découvrez les parties des plantes et leurs besoins.","Animals and Habitats":"Animaux et habitats","Match animals with their needs and homes.":"Associez les animaux à leurs besoins et habitats.","Weather and Seasons":"Météo et saisons","Observe weather and connect it to the seasons.":"Observez la météo et reliez-la aux saisons.","Materials and Properties":"Matériaux et propriétés","Compare objects by texture, strength, and flexibility.":"Comparez la texture, la solidité et la souplesse.","Light, Sound, and Motion":"Lumière, son et mouvement","Investigate how things move, shine, and make sounds.":"Étudiez comment les objets bougent, brillent et produisent des sons."},
